<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank 13-wk bills undersubscribed at 13.5%.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank 13-wk bills undersubscribed at 13.5%.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Thursday accepted bids totalling 3.075 billion crowns in its auction offering five billion crowns in 13-week liquidity bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Limit price on the Dutch auction was set at a gross yield of 13.5 percent, and all accepted bids were at that level.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
